hat if you stumble upon loot you secretly desire? The choice is yours \u2014 always. Just remember: that freedom lasts\u2026 only as long as the guild\u2019s reputation holds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/extras/b33603025efc458be60ffd41826ba4d7.poster.avif?t=1750323110\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/extras/b33603025efc458be60ffd41826ba4d7.webm?t=1750323110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/extras/b33603025efc458be60ffd41826ba4d7.mp4?t=1750323110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Guild Tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the guild tavern opens its doors. Adventurers drop by to unwind after a long day, bringing with them tales of all kinds \u2014 from the ordinary to the extraordinary, and perhaps even a story of love or two. Cook up \u201cmonster cuisine\u201d using ingredients from defeated beasts, and sit back as you listen to the many voices of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster cuisine can be dangerous!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking with ingredients from monsters is no easy task \u2014 they can be far too sticky, or worse, potentially addictive if mishandled. That\u2019s why it\u2019s crucial to understand their properties and choose the right method of preparation. You\u2019ll need balancing ingredients, the right blend of spices, and even consider the elemental traits of the dish. Sound complicated? Don\u2019t worry \u2014 Caul, the magical cooking pot (and your unofficial head chef), will be there to help every step of the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/extras/ba0efbda8d58012d908915f8bb3ce981.poster.avif?t=1750323110\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/extras/ba0efbda8d58012d908915f8bb3ce981.webm?t=1750323110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/extras/ba0efbda8d58012d908915f8bb3ce981.mp4?t=1750323110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Thirst and Trials of Adventurers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elf who left the Forest of the World Tree after losing the ability to use mana.\u2028 A dwarf who became an adventurer despite being a blacksmith \u2014 because he fears fire. Every adventurer carries their own scars, their own quiet struggles.\u2028 These are stories of those who simply long for an ordinary day\u2026 and of the strength it takes to overcome what lies beyond that thirst. Would you care to listen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/extras/12bc269abe6ca70f38092b576de2d8ad.poster.avif?t=1750323110\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/extras/12bc269abe6ca70f38092b576de2d8ad.webm?t=1750323110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/extras/12bc269abe6ca70f38092b576de2d8ad.mp4?t=1750323110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
